<<<
spontaneous development has worked badly here; piteous has senses l & 2, pitiable senses 2 & 3, & pitiful senses 1, 2, & 3—a very wasteful confusion, but too inveterate to be got into order at present. See also PLENTEOUS.
===
spontaneous development has worked badly here; *piteous* has senses 1 & 2, *pitiable* senses 2 & 3, & *pitiful* senses 1, 2, & 3—a very wasteful confusion, but too inveterate to be got into order at present. See also ^^PLENTEOUS^^.
>>>

